Local evidence at exact head:
- focused M54: **13/13 PASS**;
- M54 + artifact/package/repository-audit fixtures: **59 tests PASS**, 1 expected pre-wheel membership skip;
- combined M53+M54 TCP family: **38/38 PASS**;
- broader `test_inbound_*.py`: **415 executable tests PASS**; 8 legacy import errors are only because the deliberately clean developer interpreter has no `olp` installed;
- repository audit: **PASS — 64 Markdown / 205 Python / 13 vector files / 816 vectors**;
